    "title": "Metis HR & Finance Oracle Roles",
    "description": "This contract aims to bring in niche Oracle fusion roles that will be embedded into the civil servant teams.\r\n\r\nThe services supported include:\r\n- Oracle Fusion Product SMEs (subject matter experts) across the Finance functional modules including General Ledger, Financial Close, Accounts Payable, Procurement and Purchasing, Cash and Banking Management, Tax, Travel and Expenses.\r\n- Oracle Fusion Product SMEs across the HR functional modules including Position Management, Onboarding and Deployment, Employee management, Compensation, Payroll, Talent, Development and Learning.\r\n- Delivery Managers experienced in delivery of SaaS ERP solutions.\r\n- All roles will strengthen Home Office support for the Synergy Cluster implementation of Oracle Fusion.",
